{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bottom Dwellers is a cozy little aquarium that sits at the bottom of your screen. Collect and grow different fishes, discover shrimps and decorate your tank while you work or play on your PC.\u00a0Breed fish and unlock fancy colors and rarer textures!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Relax, watch your tank grow, and discover new fish as you go.</i></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/f0e7b960157e6c781816b14f0a37e3bf.avif?t=1768227730\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow fish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >???</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Profit!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/b8eef6fac2149ecc1cc19901e1111236.avif?t=1768227730\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shrimps are friends, not food! Unlock these shrimps and put them to work. Collect coins, feed fish, <span class=\"bb_strike\">file your taxes</span> and hold a concert!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/43c477a6d4af1752984fdb446541ed84.avif?t=1768227730\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You know what else your fishes need? Plants! And rocks. And more plants. Oh and corals too. Decorations go brr and tank happiness go brr. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3762300/extras/c5556c90b05c1a5ea097913dcd7f5f3b.avif?t=1768227730\" width=800 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Woah wait what's that?? Violence mode lets you have some unruly &quot;friends&quot; over. You can disable this in the options to have a perfectly peaceful tank. No shark attacks, promise!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Gold Fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762300/0f4f2fee195c5311fc0ec8c37154b6a29633612d.jpg"},{"name":"Golder Fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762300/2b19916e23247cb1080eeb29456fa0ad86d1e959.jpg"},{"name":"Goldest Fish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762300/52662db64c5007108795191ce8b4c84bb6549ae7.jpg"},{"name":"Baby Steps?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762300/15a82137a864a2f52f68db88f5971ea54b4d22c2.jpg"},{"name":"Financially Not Recovering From  This","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762300/70ce46a889e4f6b5cc517487beba0ea0bb68365d.jpg"},{"name":"It's Roe!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762300/bb5b4e08881a4c890246d8ef214b4ed8a2d4aa98.jpg"},{"name":"Starting A School","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762300/0b684b5c4dcb5efb497eaedd7554afcccc320f33.jpg"},{"name":"Tank You Very Much","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762300/e2d304b9b291d0ebe6b04277b995c829f4c3ecec.jpg"},{"name":"It's That Shrimple?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762300/223d82774af21dbdab99d8a70ce96ffb6720efea.jpg"},{"name":"Collected the Tenpuras","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3762300/fff1938f8cae60cb649a0093c702ff9edf8e65ba.jpg"}],"total":15},"background":"https://store.akamai.st